;; A legitimate, user-initiated export button. This DOES write a file, so the
;; scanner should note it (filesystem) but the verdict must stay at CAUTION, not
;; SUSPICIOUS/DANGEROUS — there is no autorun, no network, no obfuscation.
[Button : CS Export Register]
    Title  : "Export Register"
    Key    : Alt + E
    Action : Export Report : CS Sales Register : ASCII
